# Block34 goal

Determine whether the exact Block32 returned-pair law can become a physically
normalized Record source that selects its free parameter, rather than merely
carrying that parameter into gravity.

The campaign has four ordered gates:

1. reconstruct the actual front-conditioned pair tensor from all sixteen
   outcomes and distinguish geometric front transversality from a physical
   four-dimensional Ward identity;
2. classify what lambda-independent homogeneous conservation, count-once
   debit/recoil, and linear gravity response can and cannot select;
3. execute the strongest noncircular absolute-normalization candidate: the
   fixed algebraic-trace-normalized tangent of the equality/off-diagonal pair
   partition, tested against a unit Fisher/source-action condition;
4. audit whether the source identity, reference normalization, coupling, and
   nonzero-source condition are licensed by the current foundation or merely
   reproduce a conditional bridge.

Success means either a positively retained-ready singleton parameter locus
from existing authority, or an exact minimal missing-law statement with every
live normalization route and counterroute disclosed.  A homogeneous Ward
identity, a supplied conversion coefficient, or a parameter-dependent source
normalization is not success.

No axiom, primitive registry, audit surface, or TOE score may be edited by
this campaign.
